<%= docs_render 'page_metadata', title: 'Interfaces', description: 'Sets of fields that object types share, so they can be queried together.' %>

An interface defines a set of fields that multiple object types can implement. For more
information, see the [GraphQL interface documentation](https://graphql.org/learn/schema/#interfaces).

<%= docs_render 'deprecation_warning_header' %>

<% sorted_by_name(@interfaces).each do |interface| %>

## <%= name(interface) %>

<%= render_interface_body(interface) %>
<% end %>
